B. Tor: use real Tor daemon sidecar, not application simulation.

Official Tor onion-service setup:
https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/setup/

Production design:
- C Tor daemon sidecar/process (mature path)
- PMail HTTP service binds Unix socket or loopback only
- torrc:
  HiddenServiceDir <mounted secret volume>
  HiddenServicePort 80 unix:<pmail socket>
- read actual generated hostname file
